<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $60-5/8(FIM 304.90).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS DOWN AT $60-5/8(FIM 304.90).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR closed down $0-5/8 at $60-5/8 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Nokia's Wall Street closing equals about 304.90 markka.</p>
<p>In Helsinki on Wednesday, Nokia A closed up three markka at 310.50 markka.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) were untraded in New York on Wednesday. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.70 markka at 95.70.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR ended flat at to $22-5/8 on Wall Street. The price equals about 113.80 markka. In Helsinki on Wednesday, Rauma closed down one markka at 114.00.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
